WEBVTT

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:14.720
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.960
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:22.360
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.400
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:29.340
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.920
What? Are you serious?

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:43.360
Yes. l thought it through, and that is my choice.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:48.460
You and l, and Tokiko will have to bear with it for a while, but...

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.330
lf it works, everyone can be saved!

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:54.500
Give us a hand, Chono.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.130
ln return, you can have your showdown with me.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:02.410
Whenever, wherever, and however way you wish to settle it.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:03.380
How about it?

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:05.170
Muto...

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:07.950
Hmmm...

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:10.050
Yes, l see.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:14.290
lt does sound like a better deal than the one l was proposing...

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:17.650
Just don't mess up.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:23.000
<i>When You Die, I'll Die With You</i>

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:39.250
Buster Baron continues to engage Victor.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.450
Cover fire from other units continues with their wave of attacks,

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.820
but most of the units have been wiped out.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.520
Considering our available forces remaining,

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:50.990
l'd say that the conclusion of this decisive battle is near...

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:55.500
Our only hope lies with
Great Warrior Chief's Buster Baron and...

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.230
Kazuki Muto's white kakugane...

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.470
Victor has begun to move!

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.510
He is rapidly approaching Buster Baron!

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.780
Engagement is imminent!

00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:10.480
The time has finally arrived...

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:11.510
Yeah...

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:12.850
Here, as well...

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.690
The white kakugane is ready!

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:17.280
Let's go!

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.580
Tokiko!

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:24.200
You're late!

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:26.660
We were supposed to meet up with everyone a long time ago!

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:29.030
Sorry. l was buying some <i>takoyaki.</i>

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.530
Where is everybody else?

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.370
They're late as well.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.370
Everyone is enjoying the Summer Festival a little bit too much.

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:36.570
Take it easy.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.840
lt only happens once a year,

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.000
and there's still time before the fireworks starts.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:45.910
You...seem relaxed...

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.310
Summer is almost over...

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:56.130
and we must still settle the matter with Victor and the white kakugane...

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:57.530
And yet you're..

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:02.800
lt's because you shared your courage with me the other day.

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.480
Are you, by any chance...worried?

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.620
To be honest...a little...

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.420
l have faith in you, but...

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:29.490
<i>How you will use the white kakugane</i> <i>is a mystery to me.</i>

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:33.830
Well, in that case,

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:37.560
shall l return a bit of the courage that you shared with me the other day?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.100
ldiot...

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.090
My! l thought there was a change in the atmosphere

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.290
since you two got back the other day.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.450
Oh, go on, go on.
Don't let me interrupt you.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.320
Well, then.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.520
Like hell we would!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:07.890
See, here, this is just...

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:11.230
No need to hide it.
Everyone will be happy for you!

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:12.670
Congratulations!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.070
Thanks!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.300
Thank you...

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.070
Tokiko! Muto!

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:27.880
Tokiko...

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.290
Right...

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:31.350
Another mission?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.120
So suddenly?

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.760
Well, l suppose it can't be helped.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.500
After all, my big brother fights to protect everyone, right?

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:40.630
Mahiro...

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:44.130
There's no time! Please hurry!

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:46.000
Mahiro...

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.160
This might be a long goodbye, but...

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:54.550
I'll be sure to return, so don't worry.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:56.740
Okay...!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.980
<i>A long... goodbye?</i>

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:03.620
Give my regards to everyone...

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:10.090
A helicoptoer?

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.690
Mappy! What was that just now?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.690
Don't tell me that was
Kazuki and Tokiko?!

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:16.790
lt was...

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:22.900
He said it'll be a long mission,

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.600
but not to worry...

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:28.570
Mappy?

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:30.010
Mahiro...

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:32.950
l know it can't be helped...

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:36.690
After all, my big brother fights to protect everyone...

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:38.280
Still...

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.690
lf you do anything to make Tokiko cry...

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.590
then I'll get mad at you!

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:47.860
Kazuki...

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:52.860
What did you mean back there by "a long goodbye"?

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:58.030
Muto. Look out the right-hand window.
Down below.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:19.700
There is nothing left for me to teach you as a Warrior Chief.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:24.230
l have left the choice up to you.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.630
Warrior Kazuki...

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:33.810
The white kakugane, is ready.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.640
<i>Drive it into the chest</i>

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.510
<i>so it will overlap with</i> <i>the embedded black kakugane.</i>

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:42.880
<i>lt will then cancel out the black kakugane,</i> <i>and render it powerless...</i>

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:46.320
<i>Muto... Have you decided</i> <i>how you will use it?</i>

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:47.890
Yes.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:52.290
<i>l see... Then please take it.</i>

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.000
All right.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.070
Now everything's ready on my end.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.970
<i>Mu...to...</i>

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:12.110
<i>l...am...truly...sorry...to have...</i>

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.980
<i>involved you in...such a matter...</i>

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:19.190
Dr. Alexandria!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.690
<i>Her brain has reached</i> <i>its physical limit!</i>

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.290
<i>Even though they have been cloned,</i>

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.590
<i>the original is well over</i> <i>a hundred years old...</i>

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.100
You got what you came for...

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:33.130
Now get out of our sight.

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:36.930
<i>There is still...</i>

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:41.480
<i>time left before you</i> <i>reach the battlefield,</i>

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:45.950
<i>so think it over one last time.</i>

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:55.280
Wow!

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:56.860
He did it!

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:58.360
No...

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:08.570
His regenerative powers are similar to your Gekisen.

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.270
But there is an overwhelming difference

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.370
in the amount of energy being used.

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:15.910
Where is that energy coming from?!

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.520
<i>He is draining energy</i> <i>from the ocean life,</i>

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.810
<i>every single one of them.</i>

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:27.890
<i>The energy available to Victor</i> <i>on this Earth is now limitless!</i>

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:31.690
lt's too big!

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:32.630
Great Warrior Chief!

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.500
Buster Baron,
Right Arms On!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.040
Buso Renkin of the Japanese Sword!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.100
Sword Samurai X!

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.370
A different type of Buso Renkin...

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.030
...came out of Buster Baron's arm!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.050
There's nothing to be surprised about.

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.740
That's Buster Barons' special property...

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:51.850
lt scans and materializes

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:55.110
the Buso Renkin of the warrior boarded inside the sub-cockpit of Buster Baron.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.520
Everything from its form to special property is greatly enhanced.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:04.490
Our original plan was to use
Sakimori's Silver Skin with it, but...

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:09.100
You have an excellent Buso Renkin.
Warrior Shusui...

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:11.360
l am deeply honored...

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:16.410
l shall scatter away all energy attacks as though they were mist...

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:18.800
All right! Now it's our turn!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.880
Let's go, you bastards! lt's our turn to take the stage!

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:22.880
—Right!
—Right!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.380
Killer Rabies!

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:28.720
Secret Trail!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.010
Bubble Cage!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.020
Gekisen!

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:37.860
Eat this!

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.900
The Five Thousand
One Hundred Degree Flame...!

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.660
Blaze of Glory!

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.740
Knuckle Guards, Set!

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.020
Demon of Alchemy!

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:03.380
Return to dust!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:19.470
That...put it all to an end...

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.370
No, but this will be the end of you...

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:31.040
The real Victor at his Third Stage?!

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:34.050
Then, what was that giant we've been fighting?!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.550
A shadow created

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.110
with the remains of the dead sea life he drained energy from?!

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:40.780
Buso Renkin of the Great Ax!

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:42.320
All hands, evacuate!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.720
Fatal Attraction!

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:57.500
We shall be arriving shortly.

00:10:57.980 --> 00:11:00.740
Please be ready to take action.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.650
What took you so long?

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:05.410
l was getting tired of waiting!

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:08.380
Papillon!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.650
Hey there.

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:11.750
lt's ready, more or less, Muto.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:15.490
One of the two items that you ordered...

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.200
Thank you, Chono.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.140
With this, everything is ready for the time being!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.140
Kazuki... Are you saying that there's another option

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.110
besides sacrificing you or Victor?!

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:37.350
lt's not that one already exists; l am about to create one now!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.650
First, this white kakugane!

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:42.150
I'll use this to restore Victor to human form

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.820
and put an end to his rampage!

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:46.650
But if you do that, then what about you?!

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:49.930
That is where this new type of flask ordered by Muto,

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:52.620
and built by yours truly, comes in to play.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.860
This will place Muto in a state of suspended animation,

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:59.530
temporarily stopping him from evolving to the next stage.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:07.440
Following that, l shall complete a second white kakugane

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:10.140
and restore Muto to human form.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.480
And that is when
I'll have my showdown with you!

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:16.340
Don't forget your promise.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:20.190
Then you better wake me up soon!

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:25.230
Gota, please look after Tokiko...

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.530
You have my word not as a rival of love,

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.260
but as a comrade!

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.940
I'll look after Tokiko for you!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.570
So you can go fight and sleep without worries,

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.340
and then be sure to come back!

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:42.410
You got that?!

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:44.840
Yeah...

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:48.380
Tokiko...

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:52.590
<i>lt's kind of a long goodbye.</i>

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.790
<i>But it's not forever.</i>

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.260
l understand.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.660
But first, we have to make sure that the strike

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:04.290
to implant the white kakugane into Victor is a success...

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.440
<i>l will not allow this farewell</i> <i>to be forever!</i>

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:12.770
Kazuki, when you make that strike l will do it with you!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.170
Victor confirmed!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.140
Coming into range in one minute!

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.630
All of the responsibility for this operation lies with me.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:35.630
l will try to hold him off here,

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:38.260
so the rest of you retreat as far as you can...

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:39.060
l can't allow that.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:43.000
All things associated with alchemy...

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.810
shall be wiped from the face of this earth.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:52.480
Alchemy, the kakugane, the homunculi...and the Buso Renkin!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.710
l shall never forgive a single one of them!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.480
To the likes of your kind who would hold a young child

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:24.640
responsible for our sins, turning her into a monster...

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.480
and sending her to destroy her own father

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.250
who's been turned into a monster!

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.450
From that moment on,

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.520
l vowed to annihilate all of Alchemy, yet failed...

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.000
l awake 100 years later to find

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:45.370
the very same mistakes of my time being repeated today!

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:47.630
lt was different with him!

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.460
lt was purely a coincidence...

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.170
What has become of that boy?

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:55.980
Have you not tried to re-exterminate him, as was done with me?

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:58.970
Your kind always resorts to re-extermination!

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:01.480
Anger!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.250
Anger is all that's left!

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.720
ls everyone all right?!

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:08.320
A new enemy?!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.260
Don't let go of my hand.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:17.830
l know.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.930
l'm always telling you, aren't l?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.010
You and l...

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.910
—act with one heart and mind!
—act with one heart and mind!

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:28.980
You are...!

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.410
Near Death Happiness!

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:33.870
You're in the way. Move!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.080
Motor Gear!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:37.990
—Pierce through!
—Pierce through!

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:40.080
—Our Buso Renkin!
—Our Buso Renkin!

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:52.730
Energy...!

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:54.600
...is being released!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.910
Victor is being restored!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:06.520
lt failed!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:07.650
But still!

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:12.390
His skin is returning to its original olive color!

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:15.130
The white kakugane is definitely working!

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.420
lts power output seems to be inadequate to cancel out

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.630
the black kakugane in me--

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.900
one who has advanced to the Third Stage!

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:30.260
Boy... Like myself, you must have also been hunted down by the Army

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.610
and almost killed by those closest to you!

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:37.410
And yet if you still intend to fight me, then l will not argue!

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:39.380
Here he comes, Kazuki!

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:40.770
Don't let go of my hand!

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.080
You and l act with one heart and one mind.

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:46.360
The moment of your death shall be the moment of my own!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:49.250
l'm sorry.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.150
What?

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.590
l'm sorry, Tokiko...

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:56.060
l can't keep that promise...

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.780
l am truly...sorry...

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:13.510
Kazuki!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:14.980
Muto!

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.720
Kazuki Muto!

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:22.690
Energy...

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.490
Full Blast!

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.660
<i>Say...Victoria...</i>

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:31.060
What is it, Mama?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:35.740
<i>lf you should meet your Papa,</i> <i>tell him...</i>

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:42.280
<i>l...will always...love...him...</i>

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:45.740
l will...

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:49.180
But, Mama, if you are the one who meets Papa...

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:51.160
then please tell him...

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:56.760
that l can live on... even if it's all by myself.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:17.040
<i>Kazuki!</i>

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:18.680
<i>Kazuki!</i>

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:19.940
<i>Kazukin!</i>

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.480
<i>That man...</i>

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:22.750
<i>That boy...</i>

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:23.890
<i>That guy...</i>

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.720
<i>Kazuki Muto...</i>

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:26.950
<i>That brat...</i>

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.280
<i>Mr. Muto...</i>

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:29.960
<i>Warrior Muto...</i>

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:31.450
<i>Kazuki Muto...</i>

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:32.830
<i>Muto...</i>

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:34.130
<i>Muto...</i>

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:38.370
<i>Kazuki...</i>

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:39.800
<i>Upperclassman Muto...</i>

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.440
<i>Upperclassman Kazuki...</i>

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:48.850
<i>Big Brother...</i>

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:01.590
You thought well.

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:07.830
On the lifeless surface of the moon, the energy drain is useless.

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:11.300
lt comes down to a match of pure strength and skills.

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:12.970
However...

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.200
whether you win or lose,

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:18.430
you will no longer be able to return alive.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.640
This determination of yours...

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.010
Where does it come from?

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.640
lt comes, of course...

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.750
From that planet!

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:39.920
Back there live many people that l want to protect!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.300
As well as the one l want most of all to protect!

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:50.670
From that day forward...

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:55.970
From that day forward, up until this day, a lot has happened, but...

00:19:57.850 --> 00:20:02.180
All l can remember now... are the good times.

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:17.260
Kazuki... Kazuki...

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:21.910
Kazuki... Kazuki... Kazuki...

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:25.370
You idiot! I'll never forgive you, Muto!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:28.240
How dare you make Tokiko cry!

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:32.240
And now...there is no one left...

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:37.050
Who will know me...
Call me by my name!

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.780
Kazuki!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:47.410
What could there be for me in this land, on this planet?

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:50.580
On this planet where you no longer exist.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:55.520
But even still, this planet is the world you protected, isn't it?

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:58.360
Next time: "No One Could Ever Take His Place"
